<title>USA: Archer Daniels cuts Pilgrim's Pride stake.</title>
<headline>Archer Daniels cuts Pilgrim's Pride stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Archer-Daniels-Midland Co said Tuesday it has reduced its stake in Pilgrim's Pride Corp to 6.38 percent, or 1,761,382 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the Decatur, Ill, food conglomerate said it sold 3,753,518 shares in Pilgrim's Pride, a Pittsburg, Texas, chicken producer, on July 22 at $11.625 each.</p>
</text>
